            "value" : "按工具计数；同一工具有多个安装时，分类可能重叠。“官方安装程序”说明安装来源，不代表安全认证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counts installation copies by source. A tool installed through multiple sources is counted in each source. Select a source to view its tools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
