    },
    "uv: Python package and project manager. Counts command-line tools installed through uv, not the number of uv copies." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "uv：Python 包和项目管理工具。这里统计通过 uv 安装的命令行工具，不是 uv 自身的副本数量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It points to %@, which no longer exists. This can happen after its app is removed. Check the resolution below before changing the link." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它指向的 %@ 已不存在，可能是所属应用被移除后留下的。更改链接前，请先查看下方处理方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ready to handle" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可直接处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI State confirmed this broken link can be moved to the Trash. It will check the link again and ask for confirmation first." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CLI State 已确认可以把这个失效链接移到废纸篓。操作前会重新检查链接并请你确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you still need the original app, reinstall it instead of removing the link." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果仍需使用原应用，请重新安装应用，而不是移除链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System managed" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统管理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link is in a macOS-managed location. CLI State cannot remove it, and manual deletion is not recommended." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此链接位于 macOS 管理的位置，CLI State 无法移除，也不建议手动删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave the link in place; a macOS update or the component installer can repair it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留此链接；macOS 更新或该组件的安装程序可能修复它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Administrator required" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要管理员授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account cannot write to %@, so CLI State cannot move this link to the Trash automatically." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前账户不能写入 %@，因此 CLI State 无法自动将此链接移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need the original app, reinstall it. Otherwise, reveal the exact link in Finder and move it to the Trash with administrator authorization." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果仍需原应用，请重新安装。否则，在访达中定位这个确切的链接，经管理员授权后移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recheck needed" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要重新检测"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link no longer matches an actionable cleanup candidate. It may have changed since the last scan." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此链接已不符合可处理的清理条件，可能在上次扫描后发生了变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check again before changing or removing it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更改或移除前，请先重新检测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS can add this directory only while its component is mounted. Its absence does not require cleanup." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 只会在对应组件挂载时加入这个目录；目录暂时不存在，无需清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this system PATH entry unchanged." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留此系统 PATH 条目，不需要修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PATH and shell aliases can come from several startup files or apps. CLI State cannot identify the exact source safely enough to edit it for you." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PATH 和 Shell 别名可能来自多个启动配置文件或应用。CLI State 无法可靠判断具体来源，因此不能代你修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Several installations may be intentional or needed by other projects. Removing one automatically could break those projects." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多份安装可能是有意保留的，也可能被其他项目依赖。自动移除其中一份可能导致项目无法运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This runtime comes with macOS and cannot be upgraded or removed separately by CLI State." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此运行环境随 macOS 提供，CLI State 无法单独升级或移除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install a supported runtime beside the system copy, then choose it for your projects through PATH or the project's version manager." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "并行安装受支持的版本，再通过 PATH 或项目的版本管理器选用它；保留系统副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This issue needs a decision about your tools or environment before any change can be made safely." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安全修改前，需要先确认你对工具或环境的使用方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resolution" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "处理方案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI State cannot move these links because your account cannot write to %@. Finder may ask for administrator authorization." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前账户不能写入 %@，CLI State 因此无法移动这些链接。使用访达处理时，macOS 可能要求管理员授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select all links in Finder" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在访达中选中全部链接"
