        }
      }
    },
    "CLI State cannot confirm that this unavailable executable is a standalone broken link safe to remove." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CLI State 无法确认这个不可用的可执行文件是否为可安全移除的独立失效链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the tool details and repair or reinstall it with the manager that owns this installation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开工具详情，使用管理这份安装的工具修复或重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These links point to the removed %@ app." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些链接都指向已移除的 %@ 应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you still need the original app, reinstall it. Otherwise, move only the broken links to the Trash in Finder, authorizing the change if macOS asks." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果仍需原应用，请重新安装；否则只在访达中将这些失效链接移到废纸篓，并在 macOS 提示时授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This macOS-managed link points to %@, which is currently unavailable. Do not remove the system link manually." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个由 macOS 管理的链接指向 %@，其目标当前不可用。不要手动移除该系统链接。"
          }
